2026-10-21T05:09:15.4258510Z [36;1m  echo "The committed macOS 27 arm64 reference includes joint Styles and Texture production and is a regression baseline, not a performance target; committed tolerances absorb normal hosted-runner noise while structural helper-launch maxima remain hard limits."[0m
